        <navPoint class="chapter" id="num_591" playOrder="588">
          <navLabel>
            <text>SCENE V.——HARPAGON, ÉLISE and CLÉANTE are seen talking together at the back of the stage.第五场——阿巴贡，埃莉斯和克莱昂特在舞台后面说话。</text>
